                },
                {
                  "label": "Avg coupling",
                  "value": "0.41",
                  "info": "Share of a zone's imports that cross its own boundary. Higher means the zone is more entangled with the rest of the codebase, so a change inside it has a wider blast radius."
                },
                {
                  "label": "Avg cohesion",
                  "value": "0.63",
                  "info": "Share of a zone's imports that stay inside it. Higher means the zone holds together on its own terms; low cohesion with high coupling is the pair worth governing."
